  "question": {
    "text": "The kinetic energy $\\left(\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{k}}\\right)$ of a particle moving along $X$-axis varies with its position $(X)$ as shown in the figure. The force acting on the particle at $X=10 \\mathrm{~m}$ is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/8b2s3wWt6XYjxM3EvC7Mn128aVSy6ahtCztOaaAWwkQ.original.fullsize.png\">",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "O3qve",
      "text": "$5 \\hat{\\mathrm{i} N}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Zlxb8",
      "text": "$0 \\mathrm{~N}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cUzvM",
      "text": "$97.5 \\hat{\\mathrm{i} N}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GXchl",
      "text": "$-5 \\hat{\\mathrm{i} N}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\frac{d k}{d x}=\\frac{d\\left(\\frac{1}{2} m v^2\\right)}{d x}=\\frac{1}{2} m \\not{2} v \\frac{d v}{d x}=m a=F\n$$\nSo, Force is slope at $x=10 m \\quad F=-\\frac{20}{4}=-5 \\hat{i}$",
    "image": null
  },
